          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7A"
            },
            "chunk_type": "risk_factor",
            "content": "As a result of our foreign operations, we incur costs and we carry assets and liabilities that are denominated in foreign currencies, while sales of products are primarily denominated in U.S. dollars. We maintain a foreign currency hedging strategy which uses derivative financial instruments to mitigate the risks associated with changes in foreign currency exchange rates.",
